<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ashaolu, Ashaolu & Co. | Legal Practitioners & Consultants</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: #f8f9fa; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }
        header { background: #1e3a8a; color: #fff; padding: 2.5rem 1rem; text-align: center; border-bottom: 4px solid #f59e0b; }
        header h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; letter-spacing: 1px; }
        header p { color: #f59e0b; font-size: 1.1rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; }
        nav { background: #111827; padding: 0.8rem; text-align: center; color: #fff; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
        .card { background: #fff; padding: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        h2 { color: #1e3a8a; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.5rem; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding-left: 10px; }
        .services-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
        @media (min-width: 600px) { .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
        .service-item { background: #f3f4f6; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; color: #374151; }
        .contact-info p { margin-bottom: 0.8rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
        .contact-info strong { color: #111827; }
        
        form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
        input, select, textarea { width: 100%; padding: 0.75rem; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 1rem; }
        button { background: #1e3a8a; color: #f59e0b; border: none; padding: 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; }
        button:hover { background: #111827; }

        footer { background: #111827; color: #9ca3af; text-align: center; padding: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 3rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Ashaolu, Ashaolu & Co.</h1>
        <p>Legal Practitioners, Notary & Consultants</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <span>📍 His Grace House, University of Ilorin Road, Tanke, Oke-Odo, Ilorin</span>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <h2>Welcome to Our Firm</h2>
            <p>Ashaolu, Ashaolu & Co. is a trusted legal practice situated in the vibrant hub of Tanke, Ilorin. We deliver comprehensive, reliable, and professional legal representation to individuals, corporate bodies, and property owners across Kwara State.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Areas of Practice</h2>
            <div class="services-grid">
                <div class="service-item">Property & Land Documentation</div>
                <div class="service-item">Civil & Criminal Litigation</div>
                <div class="service-item">Corporate & Business Registration</div>
                <div class="service-item">Tenant & Landlord Dispute Resolution</div>
                <div class="service-item">Family Law & Succession</div>
                <div class="service-item">Legal Advisory & Documentation</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Book a Consultation</h2>
            <p>Send an electronic inquiry straight to our office desk:</p>
            <form name="ashaolu-consultation" method="POST" netlify>
                <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Full Name" required>
                <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your Email Address" required>
                <input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="Your Phone Number" required>
                <textarea name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Briefly describe what you need legal help with..." required></textarea>
                <button type="submit">Send Message</button>
            </form>
        </div>

        <div class="card contact-info">
            <h2>Office Address & Location</h2>
            <p><strong>Address:</strong> His Grace House, Beside Bravo Limat Petrol Station, Beckadims Area, Tanke, Oke-Odo, Ilorin, Kwara State</p>
            <p><strong>Landmark:</strong> Beside Bravo Limat Petrol Station, University of Ilorin Road</p>
            <p><strong>Working Hours:</strong> Monday – Friday: 8:30 AM – 5:00 PM</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Ashaolu, Ashaolu & Co. All Rights Reserved. Professional Web Preview.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
